This project builds on flybody (https://github.com/TuragaLab/flybody),
the fruit fly body model for MuJoCo developed by Google DeepMind and
HHMI Janelia Research Campus, licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
flybody is not redistributed here; scripts/fetch_flybody.sh downloads a
pinned upstream commit and applies the small patch in patches/.

Pretrained policies and the flight dataset come from the flybody Figshare
deposit (https://doi.org/10.25378/janelia.25309105); see the deposit for
its terms. They are downloaded by scripts/fetch_data.sh, not redistributed.

